== stage 4: mainnet read path, optional
  SKIPPED by default. This is the only stage that leaves 127.0.0.1.
  It reads mainnet through a public RPC and asks mainnet to simulate an unsigned
  transaction this build produced. Simulation never broadcasts, so it moves nothing
  and needs no key. Run it with: MAINNET=1 demo/run-demo.sh
  The last captured run is committed under demo/artifacts/mainnet-readpath/

